<title>USA: Metro Pier &amp; Exposition Authority repriced.</title>
<headline>Metro Pier &amp; Exposition Authority repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said it repriced a $505 million Metropolitan Pier and Exposition Authority, Ill., McCormick Place expansion project refunding bond issue, Series 1996A, adjusting the yields on various maturities in the current coupon and the zero-coupon portions of the issue.</p>
